I don't know the words, but here's what the meaning should be.
The sumti place for the "direction" of rigidity should express
the path such that motion along it is resisted. In the case
of the pencil lead, it is rigid along two paths, the one defined
by its longest dimension ("lengthways"), and the other defined by its
shorter dimensions ("sideways").
 
